5,1,1,talk,Rin,,We need a plan that doesn't waste our time! I'll check the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and arrival times in the badge records.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Budget is a concern. I will look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Fairness is key. I'll examine the drawn plan against the staff survey and what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Comfort is often ignored. I'm choosing sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want us to stay connected. I'll check two project strands within earshot last spring and unplanned seat shuffles in the past year.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, do you think the cost of moving is higher than the time we lose?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,It depends on the frequency of changes.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,We should ensure no one is stuck in a bad spot permanently.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,Exactly. Physical strain is a real cost.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,And so is the loss of communication if we are too spread out.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
