35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"It takes up to nine minutes to set up a desk upstairs, and people arrive at totally different times. First-come is unfair.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Re-running power costs 6,200 yen per desk every time we move. Also, we pay for floor area, even for empty desks.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Joiners learn by overhearing others, but the current plan leaves three people without any window light, which is a major complaint.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The printer area is much noisier, and the physio says it takes days to get a workstation ergonomically correct.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"Sitting together stopped the need for long handover notes, but unplanned shuffles caused weeks of interruptions.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if moving is expensive and slow, maybe we shouldn't move often?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,Precisely. Frequent changes are a financial drain.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"But if we stay fixed, some people are stuck in the dark or the noise.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, moving every few weeks would mean never getting the chair and monitor height right. It's exhausting.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Yumi,,But we can't ignore the benefit of organic learning that comes from sitting together.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,I can't afford to lose ten minutes every morning just to find a plug.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,Stability reduces the facilities bill.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"We need a way to distribute the ""bad"" seats so it's not always the same people.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,Noise and ergonomics are non-negotiable for long-term health.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"If we group by function, we might lose that cross-pollination the joiners liked.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
